Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move through\NEarth's horizon. We will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Find infinity for sure.\NLet's fight for this blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,sea and let the wind Take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,us far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,up So I can come back\Nto this moment So I can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,be present right here Throw away this drop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we share. Shut it\Nup. Do not be so afraid to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,podcast To have a friend\Nright here And I will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,always be here by your\Nside To take care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the darkest of\Ntimes, I'll try. Look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And breathe it out. It's\Nalright now. Cause we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,are the ones who are\Nmeant to move them up We
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Will move to our single\Nhorizon. We will find
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Insanity for sure. We're\Nahead for our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We will win for sure\NDreaming on We will move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,towards the horizon We\Nwill fight however we can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to be the best\Nwe will run To the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to the end We gotta be the\Nones that just keep dreaming on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't give up now\NI can never stop cause
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give everything I got to\NBecome the greatest of all times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon\NWe will find infinite portions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We will step up and we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave for sure. So keep moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take Lord Yasui and\Nreturn him to where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be honorably interred in Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We are so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the least that I can do to repay\Nthe sacrifice he made for our cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's book it, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe travels to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, at a harbor between\Nthe flower capital and Kuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The people you see here\Nare heinous criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They made an attempt on Shogun\NOrochi's life, then fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've set up checkpoints\Nall around the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Line up for your inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Step forward and show your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling they might try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't just let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's only one way, Takuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to take that boat, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need a genius\Nplan to pull this one off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse upon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,These poor people are haunted by a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go, quickly please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well somehow that worked.\NHow's Otoko all tuckered?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,out exhausted from all\Nthat crying i'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,i feel so bad i want to cheer\Nher up but what can i say
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to get up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonkichi, let me take her. Your\Nbones are hard and likely cold, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not that cold, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It cannot be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships! Ships! Ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been rendered\Nspeechless. They're splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your praise until\Nafter we fix them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I pulled them here from\Nall across the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They were left at ports\Nthat Kaido had destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll serve well for the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to transport\Nthousands of warriors to Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite dependable after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My opinion of you has improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, mine has as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you, Gar, get so conscientious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I just slept for 20 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the ships, repairs will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We have Zerfranosuke after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been a long road, with\Nmany an obstacle along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Freedom for 1-0 is within our sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you took care of Big\NMom, you dipshit. Do your damn
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Job. I'm quite certain I knocked\Nthis ship off the waterfall, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring our enemy here? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our comms were shut off in Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to forgive your\Nextremely rude attack only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.64,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,if you join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have all sorts of people\Nliving in my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that is to say, all but three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One of those races is\Nsaid to have died out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So as you might imagine,\Nthey're tough to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a shame? All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't join me, uncuff me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom and Commander Kaido used\Nto be in the same pirate crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take those cuffs off now, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You showed up after all, Lin-Win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you dopes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He told you to take these\Nhandcuffs off! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.78,0:08:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he was just joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be completely insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's been decades, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shy around strangers,\Nso I didn't come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I would kill you if you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I came here to die,\Nyou've got another thing coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,7.20 caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You think fighting one storm will stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the point of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an ally or are you an enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you need all these weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you doing waiting on\Nthis bridge in the middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me back my sword\Nbefore I have to cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you said, one's not a loss for you,\Nand it's certainly not worth dying over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Any other blade I would let you take!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shusui should have never been taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an irreplaceable\Ntreasure to this land!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shusui?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.19,0:12:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the start of Wada's ruin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When this country lost Shushui It was a\Ncrime that enraged our god of the blade Each
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,region was attacked one\Nby one Then the country
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,was conquered by the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,enemy He wasn't a god
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cease your blast for me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of performance piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would a samurai and a monk be\Nfighting each other in the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're trying to spare each\Nother's lives rather than end them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A fish man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A fish man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's... alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you? Kawamatsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two just keep going at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:14:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we'd better pull back to the\Nmainland. Hey, you! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your boss is out there kicking ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and you guys are in here cowering\Nand talking about running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you gonna escape, too? Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What gave you that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, anyway, have you gotten\Na call from Udon yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not, and we can't\Nreach them by smell, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go there and check\Nif everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just trying to escape from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.48,0:14:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just popping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that. Yes, sir. Sorry. Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? This is Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Chief Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we finally got through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.67,0:14:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you fixed the smells, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:14:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as it turns out, I don't\Nneed all these men here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're shorthanded, how\Nabout I make a trip back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just another excuse for him to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that won't be necessary. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our enemies are\Nsitting quietly behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes Straw Hat, Luffy,\NCaptain Kidd, and all the other rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I just called to let you\Nknow that all is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wish it wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're being pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that I please you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I do good? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's a good boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What splendid sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She tamed her enemy with\Na mere millet dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.56,0:15:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She can tame beasts, but also those\Nwho have obtained beast powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like everything\Nworked out in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, thanks to your\Nefforts, we are grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind, but you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was rather clever, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After I gobbled up their boss snail,\Ntheir communications were cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That means no pesky\Nreinforcements for the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day of the battle, they'll be\Nin for an ugly surprise, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So, don't forget my\Ncontributions to your cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this together now, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, I'm glad. Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With the smells working, let us\Ncontact Keenemon and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a Brahman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall repay this debt,\Neven if it costs us our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't any trouble to beat that virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And your Samurai honor thing\Nis a bit much, so no thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Tato's back in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this! You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Tato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's kicking a few friends\Nleft and right, like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All it took was a little\Npush from Lord Momonosuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and they came around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still has that aura about him, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.84,0:17:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We missed you, boss Hyogoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, it's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood-riding Omasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Split-hat Tsunaguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hojo the Pottle Gourd!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and snake eyes yatape leaders of the\Nunderground from all across the land were right
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.24,0:17:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,here this is an honor i never thought i'd\Nlive to serve you again the honor is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:18:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm so glad you're alive and well we're\Nnot worthy of your kindness yeah you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that it's backwards it's taking a crap\Nafter a bath yeah what he said precisely so
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of weirdos!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys' hands are to you, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tear your nails!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover your toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Rip off your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay in body parts for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want us to take, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.36,0:18:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And how many?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give us the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That man saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him down right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If there are any rebels left,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll find them and bring them to your\Nside, no matter where they're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid. Do your best. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you escaped death, kid. For today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you learned your lesson for\Nnext time. Shut up! You're lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My word!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you were the mystery man from\NKuri who stole Kaido's blueprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Long have we searched for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The layout of the mansion on Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame that I wasted so\Nmuch of Surfer Nosuke's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, we can plan our\Nattack on enemy territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What a reliable ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When did Yugar get so conscientious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna keep saying\Nthat every time, dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Rizzo? What's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you managed to rescue\NSir Luffy Taddo yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed we have, but that\Nis only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll spare you the details for now,\Nbut we just recruited 3,500 warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,3,500 warriors?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no small number.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've not only saved\NSir Luffy as planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you've also freed Kawamatsu\Nand recruited an army?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Kawamatsu is\Nlocked in that prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the entire region\Nis under your control now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to have achieved far\Nmore than a rescue mission, Raizo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Next stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,our friends are recruiting even more allies\Nas we speak however with that comes a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,complication which we\Nmust address this land
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.60,0:20:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,has several weapons\Nfactories as you surely know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but their products are intended for export
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and do not stay in the\Nland of wano for long
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,since our forces are mostly samurai they
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,are skilled with swords\Nand spears but as you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,can imagine those are difficult to come by
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,since Orochi has banned\Ncitizens from carrying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,weapons no matter how many allies we have\Nif they are not properly armed our plan is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,doomed to fail very well i understand this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,is a serious matter
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,i shall give
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this quandary some\Nthought but i must go i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,inform of our group's\Naccomplishments later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.48,0:21:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For the time being, I will head to Amagasa\NVillage and gauge their preparedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rizo, I look forward to sharing the\Ndetails of our mutual victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, we depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can scarcely believe my eyes,\NBut I'd know that face anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you, to think I would\Nfind you in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.28,0:22:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But never mind, if you are\Nwell, that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart leaps with joy to find you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She said something about being raised\Nby a cop after her parents died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.84,0:22:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I only ran away\Nbecause I feared for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.22,0:23:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it was only a scrap, you always\Ngave me every morsel of food you found.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that I am still\Nlacking as a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand to watch you waste away,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,especially knowing that you could\Neasily survive if you were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand the thought\Nthat you might die because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:24:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for leaving you, Kawamatsu, but\Nif nothing is done, I fear you may die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.88,0:24:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was painful, but what could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.06,0:24:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Kawamatsu, thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.52,0:24:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.24,0:24:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I washed my hair all by myself today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was close my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.80,0:24:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.62,0:24:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to next?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.56,0:24:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.22,0:25:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lady Hiyori, why'd you run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.16,0:25:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.88,0:25:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done wrong, my lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.44,0:25:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.06,0:26:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.58,0:26:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.74,0:26:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I finally know why you ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind of you to think of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.88,0:26:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Though thanks to that, I put\Non quite a lot of weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.52,0:26:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your days are numbered, Kikimari!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you could steal\Nour weapons and get away with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take them back along\Nwith everything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.66,0:26:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,These are hunting rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.46,0:26:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They take down things twice your size!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide behind that tree, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.98,0:26:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:26:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.27,0:27:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those buddies of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.34,0:27:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.48,0:27:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shoot them all to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.64,0:27:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.02,0:27:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.54,0:27:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa style!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.80,0:27:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,River of Retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhino cycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.02,0:27:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shikawa Matsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.92,0:27:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.28,0:27:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you are, Lady Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.88,0:27:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.28,0:27:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you running away again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.88,0:27:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.79,0:27:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.56,0:28:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shikawa Matsu, it's really you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.48,0:28:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
